  <Comments>
    <Comment X="-1450" Y="-520" Width="900" Height="120" Text="SteamDummy: vertex colour body, matte Lit. Eyes = 1 - vertex alpha. Each lens has its own 0-1 UV square: scanlines + rolling tracking band + flicker + vignette/pupil, emissive. Blink: every BlinkInterval s (offset by BlinkOffset) the picture collapses to a bright line (CRT power-off) and back over BlinkDuration s. Override per entity in Render > Material Parameters." />
  </Comments>
